    <briefdescription>
<para>Displays a textual progress bar that updates as a process advances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The progress bar can be used to monitor operations iterating over a vector or any process with a known number of steps. The output is sent to the console. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
